# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BPQ Dashboard — files that must never go to GitHub (2026-09-26)
# This working copy doubles as the future public repo: everything specific
# to one station (passwords, domains, logs, data) stays out of Git.
# Committed instead: the *.example templates next to each one.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Local configuration / credentials  (templates: *.example)
/db-config.php
/config.php
/bbs-config.php
/nws-config.php

# Station-specific files (live nginx config etc.) — see private/README.md
/private/

# The session journal is this station's working memory (server paths,
# security incidents, deploy history) — kept in the working copy/zip,
# never published.
/docs/SESSION-JOURNAL.md

# Message forms: third-party (TPRFN HTML Forms by N3MEL), downloaded at install
# time by scripts/fetch-forms.sh rather than published here.
/pktnet-forms/

# Runtime data written by the dashboard
/logs/*
!/logs/.gitkeep
/cache/*
!/cache/.gitkeep
/data/stations/*
/data/backups/*
/archives/*
!/archives/README.md
/wavenode-logs/

# Deploy leftovers
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak.*
*~
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
